1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:01,900
家里人还好吗
So how's the family?

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:06,160
挺好的 孩子们都长大了 海莉准备要
Great. Kids are getting so big. Haley's about to go off...

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,394
你可以不用使劲收腹了
You can stop holding your stomach in.

4
00:00:07,394 --> 00:00:10,256
-去上大学了 -你坚持锻炼吗
- To college. - You still exercising?

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:10,760
显然啊
Clearly.

6
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,860
我看到克林特·艾斯伍德
I look at a Clint Eastwood

7
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,080
和查克·诺里斯那种体魄 就想着
or Chuck Norris and I think,

8
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,880
我也可以像他们那样健壮...
there's no reason I can't stay tough like..

9
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,760
痒死人家啦
Oh, tickles!

10
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:19,780
不过
But...

11
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:21,660
痛吗
That hurt?

12
00:00:21,769 --> 00:00:24,492
不 不太...嗷
No. Not r--ow.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:26,980
怎么了
What?

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,479
应该没大碍 你感觉还好吧
It's probably nothing. You feeling okay?

15
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,900
-很好 -保险起见 做几个检查吧
- Yeah. - Maybe we'll just run a couple of tests, just to be safe.

16
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,140
什么检查呢
What kind of tests?

17
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,860
如果有问题 我会打电话给你的
If there's anything wrong, I'll give you a call.

18
00:00:36,155 --> 00:00:37,307
好
Okay.

19
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,040
房地产市场现在如何
So how's the real estate market doing?

20
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,140
贷款利率很低 正是购房的好时机
Well, interest rates are low, so it's a great time to be a buyer,

21
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,920
如果你是要卖房 那就得
But if you're a seller, you really have to...

22
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:45,460
卑躬屈膝?
Bend over?

23
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,080
没错 不过房子质量好的话
True, but a quality property is still a quality--

24
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,380
不 我是让你弓腰屈膝
No, no, no. I need you to bend over.

25
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,800
好吧
Oh. Right.

26
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:55,060
把灯调暗 诺拉·琼斯的音乐调大点
Well, let's dim the lights, crank up the Norah Jones,

27
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:56,220
速战速决吧
and get this over with.

28
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,400
回来啦 进展如何
Oh, hey. How'd it go?

29
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:02,720
棒极了 我真为他骄傲
Amazing. I was so proud of him.

30
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,140
谢了 亲爱的
Oh, thanks, honey.

31
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,020
我也挺为自己骄傲的
I'm kind of proud of me, too.

32
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:07,760
看看他们发给我的
Look at what they gave me.

33
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,200
加州律师专业协会
"California State Bar Association Award

34
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,880
环保法领域 杰出贡献奖
"For Distinguished Service in The Field of Environmental Law."

35
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:14,880
你真该去看看 他们念到他的名字
You should have seen it. They called his name,

36
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,760
他走上台 发表了很棒的得奖感言
He went up on stage, he gave a great speech.

37
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:18,600
既谦虚 又鼓舞人心
It was humble, inspirational,

38
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,860
最后还冷冷地幽了一默
with a touch of dry humor at the end.

39
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:20,920
超级有科林·费斯的范儿
It was very Colin Firth.

40
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,980
谢谢你小卡
Oh, Cam, thank you,

41
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:25,140
不过 又不是奥斯卡那种大奖
But... it's hardly an Oscar.

42
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:27,460
在环保法领域
In the environmental law community,

43
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:29,081
其实就相当于奥斯卡啦
it kinda is an Oscar.

44
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:31,140
莉莉还好吗 你们俩不会太无聊吧
So how was Lily? I hope you weren't too bored.

45
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:32,610
你开玩笑吗
Oh, please,are you kidding me?

46
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:34,440
我可爱和她聊天了 她懂的词比海莉还多
I love talking to her. She knows more words than Haley.

47
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:36,880
放在那里真好看
Oh, that looks great up there!

48
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,680
此时此刻很崇拜你舅舅吧
How impressed are you with your uncle right now?

49
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,520
崇拜得五体投地
So impressed.

50
00:01:41,572 --> 00:01:43,200
我不想毁了他们的兴致
I didn't wanna ruin their moment

51
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,980
就忍着没说出我得过的各种奖
by telling them how many awards I've gotten,

52
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,280
简而言之
But let's just say

53
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,440
那种大小的奖 我都懒得起床去领
I don't get out of bed for a trophy that size.

54
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:51,840
该死的
Darn it!

55
00:01:51,856 --> 00:01:53,680
我想发个邮件
I'm trying to send an e-mail.

56
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,040
鼠标却老是卡住
This mouse keeps sticking.

57
00:01:56,506 --> 00:01:58,829
反应那么大 这最多值十块钱
Pretty big reaction. It's 10 bucks, tops.

58
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:02,160
你正好让我想起昨晚的梦
You just reminded me about my dream last night.

59
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:05,800
我身处牧场之中 正在下楼梯
I was in the middle of a meadow, coming down a staircase,

60
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:09,460
突然一只黑老鼠出现了
then suddenly a black mouse showed up.

61
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:12,600
他停下来 直视我的双眼
He stopped, stared at me in the eyes,

62
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,520
张开他的小嘴
and opened his little mouth.

63
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:17,340
它说什么了
What did it say?

64
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:19,540
它还能说什么 杰
What did he say, Jay?

65
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:21,600
它就是只老鼠 不会说话
He was a mouse. They don't know how to talk.

66
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,100
你现在开始讲逻辑了
Now you're playing logic police?

67
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,760
你还站在牧场的楼梯上呢
You're standing on a staircase in a meadow?

68
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:29,100
在我们国家 要是有人梦到了黑老鼠
In my country, when somebody dreams about a black mouse,

69
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,400
就意味着有坏事将要发生
It means that something bad is going to happen!

70
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,360
别担心
Ah, don't worry about it.

71
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,060
我梦到了一头预示好运的蓝牛
I dreamt about a lucky blue cow.

72
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,400
-我们就扯平了 -杰
- We're good to go. - Hey, Jay,

73
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:36,940
这是我明天去打高尔夫球的行头
this is what I'm wearing for golfing tomorrow.

74
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:39,220
抬头看看 明天别跟我穿撞衫了
Wanted to give you a heads up in case there's some overlap.

75
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:40,340
你玩的是哪般啊
What are you going for here?

76
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:42,740
《重返荣耀》里的马特·戴蒙 你没看出来
Matt damon in "Bagger Vance." you didn't get that?

77
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:45,240
我看出来了 你简直以假乱真
I did. I think you look just like him.

78
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:47,420
我叫你教我打高尔夫就是为了这个
It's the whole reason I asked you to teach me to golf.

79
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:49,500
任何能穿得如此拉风的运动 我都愿参加
Any sport where you can wear this, I'm in.

80
00:02:51,868 --> 00:02:53,760
谁呀 都晚上十点了
Who is that? It's 10:00 at night.

81
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,480
-我去开 -等等 盖茨比
- I'll get it. - Hold on, Gatsby.

82
00:02:56,227 --> 00:02:58,800
有人吗 我是哈维尔 开门啊
Hola! It's Javier! Open up!

83
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,280
爸爸
Dad!

84
00:03:01,668 --> 00:03:03,617
我的小冠军
There's my campeon!

85
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,220
他就是你梦中的黑老鼠
There's your black mouse.

86
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:07,360
哈维尔 你到这儿来干什么
Hola, Javier, what are you doing in town?

87
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:10,580
我错过了曼尼的生日 而这周正好没事
Well, I missed Manny's birthday, plus I have a free week.

88
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,540
你要待一整周吗
You're staying a week?

89
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:12,640
赶快让他走
Make that go away.

90
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:13,820
曼尼 明天
So, Manny, tomorrow,

91
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:15,320
为了庆祝你长大成人
In honor of you becoming a man,

92
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:17,040
我带你去看赛马
I am taking you to the racetrack

93
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,800
享受国王的运动
to enjoy the sport of kings, hmm?

94
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,340
太好了
That's so cool!

95
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:22,660
实际上 曼尼明天要和我去打高尔夫
Actually, Manny and I have plans to play golf tomorrow.

96
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:24,380
高尔夫 那是给老头子
Golfing? Pfft! That is for old men

97
00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:25,620
和喜欢女人的女人们玩的
and for women who like women.

98
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:28,000
乖 你老爸大驾光临 我们一起去看赛马
Come on. Your dad is in town. Let's go to the races.

99
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,360
我们能一起去吗
Yeah, can we all go?

100
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,660
抱歉 宝贝 我不行
Ay, no, baby, I can't.

101
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:33,060
我答应了海莉教她西班牙语
I promised Haley that I was gonna help her with her Spanish.

102
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:35,040
-不过杰会跟你们一起去的 -什么
- But Jay's going to go with you. - What?

103
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:39,200
我不会让曼尼和哈维尔单独出去的
I'm not gonna let Manny take off with Javier by himself.

104
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,960
有一次 曼尼6岁时
Once, when Manny was 6,

105
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,840
哈维尔带他去"爱抚动物园"
Javier took him to the petting zoo,

106
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,740
结果我发现
which later, I found out

107
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:47,120
那是家脱衣舞俱乐部的名字
that was the name of the stripper club.

108
00:03:47,490 --> 00:03:49,860
真正的动物园都比那里干净
A real petting zoo would have been cleaner.

109
00:03:50,324 --> 00:03:52,955
-可我很期待打 -你去定了
- But I was looking forward to playing-- - You're going.

110
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,460
你妈还是老样子
That I don't miss.

111
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:14,000
那是什么玩意儿啊
Would you look at that?

112
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,600
哦 那个
Oh, yeah, you know,

113
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,420
我自认为我们不是喜欢显摆荣耀的人
I never saw us as trophy on the mantle people,

114
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:18,880
可你的奖杯放在上面光彩夺目
but yours looked so gosh darned good up there,

115
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:21,060
我就想 为何不晒出我们的辉煌呢
I figured, why not be proud of what we've done?

116
00:04:21,877 --> 00:04:26,440
巴斯卡特斯春季钓鱼赛第一名
Uh, "First Place, Basscatcrsrs Spring Fish-Off,

117
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,040
密苏里州北部分赛区
Missouri North Division."

118
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,977
2天钓到10条小口黑鲈
2-day total of 10 smallmouth bass

119
00:04:29,977 --> 00:04:31,745
总计34.24磅
weighing 34.24 pounds

120
00:04:31,745 --> 00:04:33,840
最大的是一条4.5磅重鱼王
with a 4 1/2-pound kicker.

121
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,700
所以你打败了其他所有12到17岁的男孩
So you beat all the other boys aged 12 through 17?

122
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,580
当然
Sure did.

123
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:40,260
看看我们的奖杯
Look at our trophies up there.

124
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:42,520
我们真是强强结合啊 是不
We're a couple of winners, aren't we?

125
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:44,840
是吗
Are we?

126
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:45,620
克莱尔
Claire?

127
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:47,780
我的剃须刀片呢
Where are all my razor blades?

128
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:48,960
-没在盒子里吗 -没
- They're not in that box? - No.

129
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,320
可能是用完了
Well, I guess they're gone.

130
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,240
不可能用完
They can't be gone.

131
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:53,840
我二十几岁时 参加了一个竞赛节目
In my 20s, I went on a game show

132
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:56,080
赢得了够用一辈子的剃须刀片
and won a lifetime supply of razor blades.

133
00:04:56,191 --> 00:04:59,688
菲尔 时间到了 你的答案是
Okay, Phil, time is up. What is your answer?

134
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,260
抱歉 菲尔
Oh! I'm sorry, Phil.

135
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:09,340
正确答案是香蕉奶油
The correct answer is banana cream.

136
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:10,220
香蕉奶油
Banana cream.

137
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:12,620
香蕉奶油 被你考到了
Banana cream. Well, you got me there, chip.

138
00:05:12,620 --> 00:05:14,420
可你也不会空手而归
But you're not leaving empty-handed, no.

139
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:16,720
你将获得够用一辈子的
You're going home with a lifetime supply

140
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:19,440
创世纪牌双面剃须刀片
of Genesis twin-blade razors.

141
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:22,040
什么 一把剃须刀有两面刀片
What?! Two blades in one razor?

142
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,476
老兄 我从未遇过这等好事
Man, it'll ever get be better than that!

143
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:27,280
你一定是把它们用完了
You must have used them all up.

144
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,000
它说的是够用一辈子
They said "lifetime supply."

145
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,920
亲爱的 你都用了15年免费剃须刀片了
Honey, you got 15 years of free razor blades.

146
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,540
你已经够赢了 别贪心了
Put that in the "Win" column and move on.

147
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,960
老妈 我朋友沃特能来我们家
Mom, is it okay if my friend Walt comes over

148
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,140
和我一起玩《反叛者3》吗
to play "Rebel Fighters 3"?

149
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:39,940
宝贝 你不觉得和一个八十岁的老头儿
Honey, don't you think it is a little weird

150
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:42,120
关系那么好有点奇怪吗
that one of your best friends is an eighty-year-old man?

151
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:44,960
不 忘年交很有趣 他经历过真正的战争
No, it makes it more fun, because he was in a real war.

152
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:46,620
他会说些很酷的话
He says cool things like

153
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:48,320
比如"地狱再会吧 克劳斯"
"See you in hell, Klaus."

154
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,020
我都不知道那话是什么意思
I don't even know what that means.

155
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,220
对了老爸 有个医生打电话来找过你
Oh, hey, dad, some doctor called for you.

156
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:56,200
桑德弗医生吗
Dr. Sendroff?

157
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,208
对 是他 你当时在洗澡
Yeah, that's it. You're in the shower.

158
00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:58,820
他说什么了
What did he say?

159
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,700
他叫你尽快回电话
He wants you to call him right away.

160
00:06:01,740 --> 00:06:03,680
那就地狱再会吧 克劳斯
Oh, well. See you in hell, Klaus.

161
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:05,680
怎么了
What's wrong?

162
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:06,440
我不知道
I don't know.

163
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,320
他昨天给我做了一些检查
He ran a few tests on me yesterday.

164
00:06:08,331 --> 00:06:09,639
他说如果有问题会打电话给我
He said he'll call if something was wrong.

165
00:06:09,639 --> 00:06:10,959
现在他打了
And now he's calling.

166
00:06:10,980 --> 00:06:12,140
你好 我是菲尔·邓菲
Hi, this is Phil Dunphy.

167
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:14,120
桑德弗医生打过电话给我
I'm returning Dr. Sendroff's call

168
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:16,240
你在开玩笑吗
Are you serious?

169
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,000
-怎么了 -他在去伦敦的飞机上
- What? - He's on a flight to London.

170
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,629
有什么办法可以让我联系到他吗
Um, is there any way I can reach him,

171
00:06:19,629 --> 00:06:22,815
或者 我能和其他什么人谈谈吗
or--uh, uh, someone else I can talk to?

172
00:06:24,086 --> 00:06:25,100
好吧
Okay. Fine.

173
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:26,460
请告诉他是紧急事件
Please just tell him it's urgent.

174
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,000
谢谢
Thank you.

175
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:29,920
天呐
Oh, boy.

176
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,900
亲爱的 我相信没事的
Honey, I am sure it's nothing.

177
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:33,480
克莱尔 我胳膊下酸软无力
Claire, I'm tender under my arm.

178
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:35,400
也许是卢克用扫帚打到你了
Maybe Luke hit you with his broomstick

179
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,600
就是你们上次玩魁地奇游戏的时候
when you guys play Quidditch.

180
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,300
我飞得多快啊 他没有碰到过我
I'm way too fast he never touched me.

181
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:40,480
我可以保证 你绝对没事
I can assure you you are perfectly fine.

182
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,900
你的安慰"真有效"
That's very comforting,

183
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,200
你大学专业是市场营销 又不是医学
coming from a marketing major at a party school.

184
00:06:51,602 --> 00:06:52,680
我看好4号马
I like the number 4 horse.

185
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,560
它熟悉这个赛道
He loves this track,

186
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:54,720
而且它爸爸赢过普里克内斯大奖赛
his dad won the Preakness,

187
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,700
最近三次比赛押它的人都赚了
Last three finishes were in the money.

188
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,280
我看好"米兰达的奇迹"
I like Miranda's miracle.

189
00:06:58,540 --> 00:06:58,900
为什么
Why?

190
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:01,080
我们班上有个女生叫米兰达
There's this girl Miranda in my class,

191
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,189
她是个美女
and she is really pretty.

192
00:07:02,189 --> 00:07:04,239
如果她也喜欢我 那一定是个奇迹
If she likes me back, it will be a miracle.

193
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,860
你能帮我押两块钱在它身上吗 杰
Would you bet $2 on that one for me, Jay?

194
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:08,580
没问题 不过你这钱一定是打水漂
Sure, but you are throwing your money away.

195
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,500
你们俩都是
You both are.

196
00:07:09,522 --> 00:07:12,266
7号马才是最终的赢家
The winner of the race will be number 7--

197
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,320
"君之乡"
my hometown.

198
00:07:13,332 --> 00:07:14,616
七号
Number 7...

199
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:17,500
它多了三磅肥膘
Well, he's carrying 3 extra pounds,

200
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,640
而且它不擅于长跑
And he hates the distance.

201
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:20,480
那些都是纸上谈兵
Those are just words on a page.

202
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:22,040
我和那只马对视时
I look the horse in the eye,

203
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:24,560
它告诉我 它会是赢家
And he tells me... he is the winner.

204
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,630
马会说话吗
Tells ya?

205
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:28,260
-听上去也许有些疯狂 -无需解释
- Perhaps this will sound crazy. - No need for the qualifier.

206
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:31,920
不过我确实能感知马的灵魂
But I have always been able to see into the soul of a horse.

207
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:34,680
绝对是我的天赋 我从不怀疑
It is a gift, and I do not question it.

208
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:38,000
就像我在银行排队时 总在最短的那条
Just like I always end up on the shortest line at the bank.

209
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:39,340
也许我应该押你这匹马
Maybe I should bet on your horse.

210
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:41,560
你在开玩笑吧 这可不是纸上谈兵
Are you kidding me? These aren't just words.

211
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:43,820
上面给你提供了各种各样的信息
They give you all this information,

212
00:07:43,820 --> 00:07:45,740
让你全面掌握情况
so you can make an informed decision

213
00:07:45,740 --> 00:07:47,420
-一押即中 -当然
- and beat the odds. - Yes, of course,

214
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:50,060
所以手拿赛马报的人"都能发财"嘛
And this is why everybody with a racing form is rich.

215
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,340
来吧 是时候下注了
Now come on. It's time to place our bets.

216
00:07:52,429 --> 00:07:54,081
你的决定是什么 曼尼
What's it gonna be, Manny?

217
00:07:57,540 --> 00:07:58,760
两块钱押"君之乡"
$2 on my hometown.

218
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,340
你确定它会赢吗
You really think he's going to win?

219
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:02,720
我只知道它的眼睛是这么告诉我的
Well, I only know what he tells me with his eyes.

220
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:06,420
别问我为什么 也许我前世是一匹马
Don't ask me why, but maybe in some previous life, I was a horse.

221
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:07,880
或者"牛头马嘴"
Or part of a horse.

222
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,540
嘿 艾丽克斯打过电话
Oh, hey, Alex called.

223
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,460
她把手机落在我们这儿了
She left her cell phone here.

224
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:17,553
她等下会回来取
She's gonna come back and get it.

225
00:08:17,563 --> 00:08:19,620
小卡 你对你的钓鱼奖杯做了什么吗
Cam, did you do something to your fish trophy?

226
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:21,820
对 我之前忘了它中间那段有趣的部分
Oh, yeah, I forgot about this fun middle part.

227
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,860
它现在看起来像是一只鱼欢快地跃出水面
You see, now it looks like a fish jumping out of the water.

228
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,440
对 刚好盖过了我的光芒
Yeah, right over mine.

229
00:08:27,223 --> 00:08:28,520
我是不是嗅到了酸味 米奇
Do I sense something, Mitch?

230
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,840
只是我的奖杯稍稍高出一点
You know, just because mine's a little taller than yours,

231
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,360
不代表你的奖杯就不受重视了
doesn't make yours any less important.

232
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,220
不 我没有那么想
Oh, no. That's not what I was feeling,

233
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:35,920
毫无那种自私狭隘的想法
not even a little bit.

234
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,500
天呐 你压根就不想看到我的奖杯被摆出来
Oh, my god. You don't like that I put my trophy up.

235
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:40,760
我只是觉得有点奇怪
I just think it's a little weird

236
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,500
恰恰在我刚赢回一个奖杯时
that immediately after I win a trophy,

237
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,480
你就把你的陈年旧奖翻出来
You feel the need to dig this thing up

238
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,940
大摇大摆地放在我的奖杯旁边
and plop it down next to mine.

239
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:46,960
我想你应该知道
I'll have you know

240
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,620
我一直都想把这个奖杯摆出来
that I want to display this for quite some time.

241
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,620
但是我把它装箱放在车库
But I put it in box in the garage

242
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:52,700
和我的其他奖杯们尘封在一起
with all my other awards--

243
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:54,923
没错 复数哦 奖杯们-
Yes, award-z--

244
00:08:55,055 --> 00:08:58,110
只是不想刺激从没得过奖的你
Out of courtesy to a sadly award-less you.

245
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,320
你那奖杯太可笑了
It looks ridiculous.

246
00:08:59,687 --> 00:09:02,780
我得的是杰出的专业奖项
Mine is a distinguished professional award

247
00:09:02,780 --> 00:09:04,380
由我的同行颁发给我
given to me by my peers,

248
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:06,900
而你的呢 是在码头上颁发给你的
and yours was given to you on a pier.

249
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:08,440
你要知道
Okay, well, for your information,

250
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,520
我得奖的时候排场可大了
when I won this, it was a very big deal.

251
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:14,220
我在杂货店出席了剪彩仪式和签名会
I cut a ribbon at the grocery store and signed autographs.

252
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:15,660
"捕鱼能手 卡梅隆·塔克"
"Best fishes, Cameron Tucker"

253
00:09:17,908 --> 00:09:19,800
你知道吗 我也想起来了
Oh, you know what? I just remembered!

254
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:22,640
我的奖杯也有一个有趣的底座呢
Mine comes with a really fun pedestal, too!

255
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:25,100
噢 来看看
Oh! Look at that!

256
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:28,020
如此一来才是正确的等级排序嘛
Oh, and proper hierarchy is restored. Mm-hmm.

257
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:29,240
除非你突然想起来
Unless you suddenly remember

258
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,200
你的小鱼还戴着一顶高帽
that your fish came with a top hat.

259
00:09:32,777 --> 00:09:33,560
好吧
Okay. you know what?

260
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,420
我要去接莉莉然后去公园
I'm gonna go get Lily from her party and go to the park.

261
00:09:35,580 --> 00:09:35,960
去吧
OK.

262
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,480
得奖后你变了 米切尔
This award has changed you, Mitchell.

263
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:40,440
你现在飘飘然飞得很高
You may be flying high now,

264
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,620
但很快 你会摔得很惨 汤姆·派迪
but pretty soon, you're gonna be free falling, Tom Petty...

265
00:09:44,060 --> 00:09:45,040
因为你心胸狭隘
Because you're petty.

266
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:46,740
汤姆·狭隘
Tom Petty.

267
00:09:46,813 --> 00:09:48,360
听懂了吗
Hmm? Get it?

268
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,860
早就懂了
About three sentences ago.

269
00:09:51,950 --> 00:09:53,360
你好啊海莉
Hola, Haley.

270
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,860
嘿 歌洛莉亚 谢谢你能过来
Hi, Gloria. Thanks for coming over.

271
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:56,789
请说西班牙语
En espanol, por favor.

272
00:09:56,789 --> 00:09:59,516
乃好 歌洛莉亚
Uh, hola, Gloria.

273
00:09:59,940 --> 00:10:01,560
谢谢你"大驾光迎"
Gracias for coming over.

274
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,080
不对 要说完整
No, the whole thing.

275
00:10:03,180 --> 00:10:04,500
我不知道后半句怎么说
I don't know the whole thing.

276
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:06,264
为什么我要学西班牙语
Why do I even need to learn Spanish?

277
00:10:06,264 --> 00:10:09,120
我住在加州 用不着西班牙语的
I live in california. I'm never gonna use it.

278
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,100
这就是美国人的毛病
That's the problem with Americans.

279
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,640
他们希望所有人都学会说他们的语言
They expect all of us to know their language,

280
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:15,800
但却不愿意花点精力学学我们的语言
but they don't even make the effort to learn ours.

281
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,887
有本事你们也到处打胜仗啊
Win a war sometime.

282
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,420
那我们就会开始学习你们的语言了
Then we'll start talking like you.

283
00:10:19,848 --> 00:10:21,213
哈 错的离谱
Ha. So wrong.

284
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,020
嘿 歌洛莉亚
Oh, hey, Gloria.

285
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:24,240
嘿 菲尔 你好吗
Hi, Phil. How are you?

286
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,180
我真希望我知道
I wish I knew.

287
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:26,366
此话怎讲 发生什么了
Why? What's wrong?

288
00:10:26,366 --> 00:10:28,100
我不希望惹你心烦
Uh, I don't wanna bum you out.

289
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:29,260
我的医生让我做了些检查
My doctor did some tests

290
00:10:29,260 --> 00:10:30,546
说如果发现什么问题他会打电话
and said he'd call if something was wrong,

291
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,620
今天早上他打了
and he called this morning.

292
00:10:32,620 --> 00:10:33,640
他说了什么
And what did he say?

293
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:34,540
我不知道 我没有接到那个电话
I don't know. I missed the call.

294
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:35,480
现在我联系不到他了
Now I can't reach him.

295
00:10:36,420 --> 00:10:37,860
那只黑色老鼠
The black mouse.

296
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:39,360
-什么 -在我梦里
- What? - In my dream.

297
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,140
是个凶兆
It was a bad omen.

298
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:42,820
但应该不是冲你来的
But probably not for you.

299
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:45,260
楼梯
The staircase.

300
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,900
不不不 你没事 你肯定没事的
No, no, no. You're fine. You're fine.

301
00:10:48,060 --> 00:10:49,920
是吗 听着
Am I? Get this --

302
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:52,480
15年前 我赢了够用一辈子的剃须刀片
15 years ago, I won a lifetime supply of razor blades.

303
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,920
但如今却用完了
They ran out...

304
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:54,740
就在今天
today.

305
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,460
你吐口水干嘛 驱赶阎王爷吗
What's with the spitting? Are you warding off death?

306
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:00,560
没有 我刚吸气
No. When I did

307
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:03,373
好像吸个虫子进嘴了
I think I suck in a little bug.

308
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:07,880
第一场赢了16 第二场赢了10块
$16 for the first race, $10 from the second race,

309
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:10,240
再加上34块 一共赢了60啊
plus $34--$60?

310
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,240
老爸你真是天才
You're a genius, dad.

311
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:12,840
功劳也不都在我
Well, I cannot take all the credit.

312
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:15,460
今天那些马都很健谈 告诉我很多信息
It is a particularly chatty group of horses today.

313
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,420
赌博我好爱 钞票轻松来
I love gambling! It's so easy!

314
00:11:17,420 --> 00:11:18,200
可没那么轻松
It's not easy.

315
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,400
对连输三场的人来说 当然不轻松
Well, not for you. You've lost, what, three in a row?

316
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:22,318
怒火中烧吧 杰
Oh, burn, Jay!

317
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:24,560
抱歉 我不该刺激你的
I'm sorry. That was uncalled for.

318
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,840
赢钱赢得脑袋晕
This is all so heady.

319
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:28,120
50块押"小培根"赢
$50 on little bacon to win.

320
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,035
啧啧
Ooh-ee.

321
00:11:29,035 --> 00:11:31,060
-是啊 啧啧 -搞什么 你们咂什么嘴
- Yeah, ooh-ee. - What? What ooh-ee?

322
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:32,780
"小培根"有点不大对劲
There is something not right about that horse.

323
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:34,800
-我也看出来了 -你看出来个屁
- I think I saw it, too. - You didn't see anything.

324
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,000
"小培根"可是夺冠热门
This horse is a heavy favorite.

325
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,660
其余的还没旋转木马跑得快呢
The rest of the pack couldn't beat a merry-go-round.

326
00:11:37,740 --> 00:11:38,760
我铁了心压"小培根"了
I'm sticking with little bacon.

327
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:39,640
等着受死吧
It's your funeral.

328
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:41,380
我们押哪匹 老爸
Who are we going with, dad?

329
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:43,240
我们不跟 宝贝
Nobody in this race, papito.

330
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:46,080
刚刚下面马圈里一片寂静无声
It was quiet down there in the paddock just now--

331
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:46,800
简直万马齐喑
too quiet.

332
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,880
好吧 爷就不信了 给我押三百
Oh, gee. You know what? Make it $300.

333
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:49,940
下血本啊
Oh, my.

334
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:51,760
告诉你小子 我此次押的绝对错不了
I'm telling you, kid, this is the one.

335
00:11:52,220 --> 00:11:53,740
想知道为什么吗
And you know how I know?

336
00:11:53,758 --> 00:11:56,186
因为它发出的声音是 "不输"
'cause it said, "pfft."

337
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,560
马才不会发出那种声音
They don't talk like that.

338
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:05,700
玛利亚为婚礼买了条美丽的白裙子
"Maria bought a beautiful white dress for her wedding."

339
00:12:06,860 --> 00:12:10,200
玛利亚买了条
Um, Maria compro

340
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:14,240
白色滴裙子
un hermoso vestido blanco

341
00:12:14,288 --> 00:12:16,760
围了... 不好意思
para su-- I-I'm sorry.

342
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:18,340
他盯着我我没法专心
I cannot concentrate with him here.

343
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:19,640
你干嘛呢
What are you doing?

344
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:23,660
将你的模样永远铭记在心
Just taking it all in.

345
00:12:27,780 --> 00:12:29,820
你是个美丽聪慧的女人
You're a beautiful, intelligent woman...

346
00:12:30,194 --> 00:12:31,711
永远记住这一点
And don't you ever forget it.

347
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,480
他有时候真是脑筋不正常
Wow, he is so weird sometimes.

348
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:40,100
不 他正常得很 他是个圣人
No, he's not weird! He's a saint!

349
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:42,060
他一旦去世了你会想念他的
And you will miss him when he's gone...

350
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,240
我是说将来
One day.

351
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:46,300
米奇尔舅舅好
Hey, uncle Mitchell.

352
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:48,326
你手机在桌上
Your, uh, phone's on the table.

353
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,340
那是什么
What's that?

354
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,000
小卡以前获得的钓鱼奖杯
Oh, Cam's old fishing trophy.

355
00:12:54,340 --> 00:12:55,560
早上我一睁眼
Yeah, when I woke up this morning,

356
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,740
它就矗在那了
That's where I found it.

357
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:58,180
就在你把奖杯放那之后吗
Right after you got yours?

358
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:58,960
谢谢支持
Thank you!

359
00:12:59,060 --> 00:13:00,860
天呐 我们可真是同病相怜
Oh, my god. Welcome to my world.

360
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:02,720
上周 组织授予我一枚奖章
Last week, I got this beautiful plaque

361
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,280
因为我在辩论队表现极其出色
from the debate team for outstanding achievement,

362
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,360
你知道我妈做了什么吗
and what did my mom do?

363
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:07,220
她翻出卢克的一条"参与奖"绶带
She found one of Luke's "participant" ribbons

364
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:09,680
以及海莉的什么"准时签到"证书
and a certificate Haley got for showing up somewhere on time,

365
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,920
然后把那俩玩意儿跟我的放在一个架子上
and put all three of them together on the same shelf!

366
00:13:11,980 --> 00:13:13,320
那含金量能一样吗
It's, like, so unfair!

367
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:15,360
我很高兴跟艾丽克斯说了这事
I was so glad I talked to Alex,

368
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:18,020
因为她跟我的感受简直完全一样
because she agreed with every single thing I was feeling--

369
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:19,440
那让我意识到
which made me realize

370
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:23,705
我表现得 就像个幼稚少女 羞涩捂脸
that I was acting like a 14-year-old girl.

371
00:13:28,818 --> 00:13:30,641
给点力啊 小破孩
Ah, come on, kid.

372
00:13:30,641 --> 00:13:32,734
你都害我损失了件装备了
I just lost an arm 'cause of you.

373
00:13:32,734 --> 00:13:33,910
给我专心点玩
Now get your head in the game.

374
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:36,700
抱歉 我爸盯着 我集中不起精神
Sorry. I can't concentrate with my dad staring at me.

375
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:39,020
我实在太爱你了
I just love you so much.

376
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,750
希望他不是在对我表白
I hope he's talking to you.

377
00:13:43,169 --> 00:13:45,900
这下好了 我死了
Ugh. Oh, great, now I'm dead.

378
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:46,960
我得去趟洗手间
I'm going to the bathroom.

379
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,040
常言道 生死乃游戏家常事
You know, they say that happens.

380
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:53,960
嘿 沃特
Hey, Walt.

381
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:58,500
你有想过死亡吗
You ever think about death?

382
00:13:59,620 --> 00:14:01,980
我都85了 死神天天盯着我呢
I'm 85. Death is my roommate.

383
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,880
医生给我打电话了
I got a call from the doctor.

384
00:14:04,172 --> 00:14:06,517
我有60%的可能性会死
There's a 60% chance I'm gonna die.

385
00:14:06,517 --> 00:14:08,166
哈 可笑的医生
Ha! Doctors--

386
00:14:08,166 --> 00:14:09,580
十年前就说我要死了
said I'd be dead ten years ago.

387
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:10,340
你看我
Look at me.

388
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:11,480
依然健康得如同...
I'm healthy as a--

389
00:14:13,763 --> 00:14:15,408
我得去换块电池了
I gotta go change my tank.

390
00:14:18,513 --> 00:14:20,600
菲尔 你得放宽心
Phil, you've gotta let this go.

391
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,440
对不起 克莱尔
I'm sorry, Claire.

392
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:22,460
我实在是手足无措
I don't know how to react

393
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:25,180
因为我发现自己有70%的可能会死
when I find out there's a 70% chance I'm gonna die.

394
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:27,920
亲爱的 听我说
Honey, listen to me.

395
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,753
你不会有事的
You're gonna be fine.

396
00:14:29,820 --> 00:14:32,700
-你真这么想 -我确定
- You really think so? - I know so.

397
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,540
克莱尔是我的后盾
Claire's my rock.

398
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:37,000
当你在飞机上遇上气流颠簸
You know when you're on a plane and there's turbulence,

399
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,100
你看看那些空姐空少
you look at the flight attendants,

400
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:39,640
如果他们笑容依旧地端茶倒水
and if they're still smiling and serving drinks,

401
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,780
你就会觉得心安
you know everything's gonna be okay?

402
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:41,400
克莱尔就像那样
That's Claire.

403
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,540
我也可以把她想象成一名警察
I could also picture her as a cop.

404
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:47,480
率先进入最后两百米的是"小培根"
And into the final furlong it's little bacon

405
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,140
其次是"布拉德的蜡光皮衣"
followed by Bradswaxjacket

406
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,640
冲啊"小培根" "小培根"冲啊
Go little bacon. Go little bacon.

407
00:14:50,940 --> 00:14:52,480
你可以的 你可以的
You got this! You got this!

408
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:54,760
冲啊冲啊冲啊
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

409
00:14:54,760 --> 00:14:57,640
冠军是九号"小培根" 领先了三马身的距离
And the winner is NO.9 little bacon by 3 lengths.

410
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,720
太棒了 我就知道
Yes! I knew it!

411
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,660
看到了吗 曼尼 狗屎运没那么多的
You see that, Manny? Dumb luck always runs out.

412
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:03,020
但如果你脚踏实地
But if you live in the real world,

413
00:15:03,020 --> 00:15:04,280
动动脑子
and you use your head,

414
00:15:04,380 --> 00:15:06,500
而非像怪医杜立德糊涂一世聪明一时
not have it in the clouds like Dr. Dolittle there,

415
00:15:06,511 --> 00:15:07,812
你会赢的
You'll do okay.

416
00:15:07,940 --> 00:15:09,700
或许这次我们应该听杰的 老爸
Guess we should have listened to Jay on this one, dad.

417
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,260
这话没错 不听杰之言 吃亏在眼前
You got that right. You should have listened to Jay.

418
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:12,300
我还要告诉你
And I'll tell you something else.

419
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:14,200
光看着马的眼睛
You can't look in a horse's eyes

420
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:15,220
是看不出个所以然的
and tell there's something wrong.

421
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:17,320
你甚至无法同时看着马的两只眼睛
You can't even look in their eyes at the same time --

422
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,701
不在一边啊
One's here and one's here!

423
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,500
走吧 我们去窗口领钱
Come on. Let's go to the window, kid.

424
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:22,720
我一个人可拿不动那么多
I may need some help carrying my winnings.

425
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:23,480
且慢
Oh. Wait.

426
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:25,560
杰 你看
Jay, look.

427
00:15:27,832 --> 00:15:28,860
调查中
Inquiry.

428
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:29,660
那是什么意思
What's that?

429
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:32,500
就是有匹马违规了
It is when a horse has committed an infraction.

430
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,300
可能违规 通常没什么大碍
Possible infraction. Usually it's nothing.

431
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:35,320
我确定
I'm sure...

432
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,780
九号马"小培根"
The number 9 horse little bacon

433
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:38,500
由于"非法阻挡"被取消冠军资格
has been disqualified for interference.

434
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:38,940
搞什么
What?!

435
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:41,895
冠军是6号马 "布拉德的蜡光皮衣"
The winner is number 6 bradswaxjacket.

436
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:42,760
瞧见没
You see?

437
00:15:43,662 --> 00:15:44,564
眼睛
The eyes...

438
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:47,020
不撒谎
They do not lie.

439
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:49,880
倒霉啊 杰
Tough break, Jay.

440
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:52,140
给
Here...

441
00:15:53,413 --> 00:15:55,012
就当是油钱
Little something for gas.

442
00:16:01,735 --> 00:16:04,251
小卡是对的 我太心胸狭隘了
Cam was right. I-I was being petty.

443
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:07,900
于是我找到他那箱奖杯
So I found his box of old trophies

444
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:09,380
决定给他惊喜
and I decided to surprise him

445
00:16:09,380 --> 00:16:11,400
等他回家时会发现全摆在壁炉上
by having them on the mantle when he got home.

446
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,820
结果倒是我自己惊讶了一番
Well, I was the one who was surprised.

447
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:16,420
我完全不知道他得过那么多奖
I had no idea how many trophies he had--

448
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,740
都是第一名 五花八门的
First place, and all of them for different things.

449
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:22,240
音乐 橄榄球 艺术展 科学展
Music, football, art show, science fair,

450
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,700
美食节
a chili cook-off.

451
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:25,660
他藏起了人生中全部的荣耀
A lifetime of accolades hidden away

452
00:16:25,660 --> 00:16:27,040
以免我自惭形秽
just so I wouldn't feel bad.

453
00:16:29,043 --> 00:16:32,191
老鼠 有老鼠 好恶心
Aah! That's a mouse! That's a mou--oh! Ew!

454
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,400
太恶心了
Oh! Disgusting!

455
00:16:35,264 --> 00:16:38,529
不 小卡 我是想把奖杯全部展出来
Oh, no! No, cam, I-I was gonna make a big display!

456
00:16:38,540 --> 00:16:39,940
我想"也是"
I believe you have.

457
00:16:41,070 --> 00:16:42,706
你误会了 小卡 里面有只...
No, no, Cam! There was a--

458
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,380
恶心
Oh! Gross!

459
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,340
曼尼 帮我个忙
Listen, Manny, do me a favor

460
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:54,260
过去帮我买杯卡布奇诺好吗
and get me a cappuccino from right over there, okay?

461
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:57,240
不用了 我现在是款爷
No, it's okay. I got it.

462
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:01,000
那个
So...

463
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,940
想聊聊刚才的事吗
You wanna talk about what happened back there?

464
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:04,880
-完全没兴趣 -其实
- Not at all. - You know...

465
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:07,683
我以眼观心的本事 不只是针对马
it is not just the horses whose souls I can read through their eyes.

466
00:17:07,700 --> 00:17:09,940
你真想知道吗 我告诉你
You really wanna know? I'll tell you.

467
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:13,140
好吧 我不烦你了
Okay. I'll leave you alone.

468
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,000
听着 别走
All right, listen, hang on.

469
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:16,160
很抱歉我在曼尼面前找你麻烦
I'm sorry I went after you like that in front of Manny.

470
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:16,760
我错了
That was wrong.

471
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:20,660
不 我懂的 没人愿意输掉比赛
No, I get it. Nobody likes to lose at the races.

472
00:17:21,500 --> 00:17:23,380
我不欠那家伙什么
I don't owe this guy anything.

473
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,320
他一年会来看儿子几次
He stops by a couple of times a year to see his kid.

474
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,540
以前对我来说是种解脱 可以休息下
It used to be a relief, gave me a nice break.

475
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:31,760
可现在曼尼和我已经情同父子
But now Manny and I, we got our own thing.

476
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:34,000
我知道自己不是他亲爹
Look, I know I'm not his dad...

477
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:38,199
但我不喜欢他的到来让我想到那一点
Maybe I don't like the reminder.

478
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:44,623
-我的天啊 -怎么啦
- Oh! Oh, my gosh! - Hey, what's up?

479
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:46,420
-怎么啦 -一听到消息我们就来了
- What? - We came as soon as we heard.

480
00:17:46,420 --> 00:17:46,840
什么消息
Heard what?

481
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:48,740
我们听说菲尔从医生那儿得到了噩耗
We heard Phil got bad news from the doctor.

482
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,860
谁说的
Who told you that?

483
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:50,460
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

484
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:54,620
不 我没说他确诊了
No, I didn't say that he got bad news...

485
00:17:54,780 --> 00:17:56,760
我说的是有那个可能
I said that he was getting bad news.

486
00:17:56,780 --> 00:17:59,140
你也只是猜测有可能
You don't know that he's getting bad news.

487
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:00,680
我看见黑耗子了
I saw a black mouse.

488
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:02,580
我也看见了
I saw a black mouse.

489
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,600
谁信啊
So he says.

490
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:06,380
-好了各位 -这比我想象的还糟
- Okay. You guys... - Oh, this is worse than I thought!

491
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,020
没事的 听我说
No, it's not. Listen to me. Listen.

492
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:09,500
菲尔没事 事实上
Phil is fine. As a matter of fact,

493
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:10,248
在他发现你们之前快闪人吧
you should go before he even knows you're here.

494
00:18:10,248 --> 00:18:11,823
不不 我们不走 我们留下
No, no. We're staying. We're staying.

495
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:14,420
一听到消息我们就来了
We got here as soon as we could.

496
00:18:14,820 --> 00:18:16,360
有买咖啡蛋糕吗
Did you bring the coffee cake?

497
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:17,860
有 在我这儿
Yes, I have it right here.

498
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:20,100
他拿下车而已 我出的钱
He carried it in from the car. I paid for it.

499
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,140
听我说 听着
Listen. Listen to me.

500
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:24,000
对于你现在所受的煎熬 我深表同情
I am very sorry for what you are going through.

501
00:18:24,280 --> 00:18:25,260
谢谢
Thank you.

502
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:26,240
这谁啊
Who is this?

503
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:26,980
何方神圣
Who, indeed?

504
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,540
我是哈维尔·迪尔加多 曼尼的亲爹
I am Javier Delgado, Manny's father

505
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:31,620
歌洛莉亚的前夫兼爱人
and Gloria's former husband and lover.

506
00:18:32,140 --> 00:18:34,260
我说这话你别觉得我冷血
I hope you do not think this is insensitive,

507
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:35,560
你是位美丽的女人
but you are a beautiful woman,

508
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:37,440
再找个男人不难的
and you will have no trouble to find a man--...

509
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:40,440
哈维尔 人家老公尸骨未寒呢
Javier! The body is not even cold yet!

510
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:43,100
"行尸"活的好好的 在楼上看篮球比赛呢
The body is upstairs watching basketball.

511
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:44,360
他没事
He is fine.

512
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:45,760
-歌洛莉亚说他病了 -没有
- Gloria said he was sick. - No.

513
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:47,880
他去看了医生 做了些检查
He went to the doctor, he had some tests.

514
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:49,080
医生来了电话 就是这样
The doctor called. That's it.

515
00:18:49,300 --> 00:18:53,500
加上他终生供应的剃刀 在今天用完了
Plus today he run out of his lifetime supply of razors.

516
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:54,540
这是个征兆
That's a sign.

517
00:18:54,553 --> 00:18:56,400
全都是无中生有
This is a lot of hocus-pocus!

518
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,460
难以置信我买个蛋糕却用在如此可笑的场合
I can't believe I bought a coffee cake over this!

519
00:18:58,600 --> 00:18:59,960
等等 我有点混乱
Wait, wait, wait, no, no. I'm confused.

520
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:01,520
医生到底怎么说的
What did the doctor say exactly?

521
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:04,280
我不知道 今早的电话我们错过了
I don't know. We missed his call this morning.

522
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:05,380
医生在周六打来电话?
The doctor called on Saturday?

523
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:07,000
-是的 那又如何 -没什么
- Yeah. So? - Nothing.

524
00:19:08,014 --> 00:19:09,921
有什么 有什么 快说
Not nothing. Not nothing. What?

525
00:19:10,746 --> 00:19:11,760
只是 那个
Well, it's just that, uh,

526
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:14,520
医生在周六打电话 通常没好事
Doctors don't usually call on Saturday with good news

527
00:19:15,543 --> 00:19:16,400
但是可能...
But they could call--

528
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,400
可能是因为其它事情
I mean, he could call with anything.

529
00:19:17,540 --> 00:19:18,720
你觉得他真病了吗
Do you think he's sick...

530
00:19:20,253 --> 00:19:23,120
这是 怎么回事
What's... what going on?

531
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:25,800
没什么 大家来串个门
Nothing. Nothing. Everybody just came by

532
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:26,820
没什么特别原因
for absolutely no reason at all.

533
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:27,620
你一脸担心的样子
You look worried.

534
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:28,920
我没担心
I'm not worried.

535
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:32,020
天呐 飞机失事前
Oh, god. The plane's in trouble.

536
00:19:32,660 --> 00:19:34,740
空姐会收好小餐车 大家扣好安全带
You put away the drink cart and you're strapping in.

537
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:38,140
-你会没事的 孩子 -肯定没事的
- You're gonna be fine, kid! - You are gonna be great!

538
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:40,020
你气色比我还好呢
I wish I looked this good.

539
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:41,480
拜托别说了 胆都被你们吓破了
Stop, please! You're freaking me out.

540
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,680
你会死吗
Are you gonna die?

541
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:45,120
我不知道 我有5%的机会可以挺过去
I don't know! There's stil a 5% chance I'll make it!

542
00:19:49,292 --> 00:19:51,340
-是桑德弗医生 -接吧
- It's Dr. Sendroff. - Okay. Okay.

543
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:52,500
亲人们 我不知道电话
Guys, I don't know what's on

544
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:53,520
那端会是什么消息
the other end of this phone call...

545
00:19:53,540 --> 00:19:56,180
但无论发生何事 只希望大家知道
But whatever happens, I just want you to know,

546
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:58,340
你们已经给了我终生用不完的幸福
you've already given me a lifetime supply of happiness.

547
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,660
我记得小时候
I remember once as a child--

548
00:20:00,660 --> 00:20:01,982
-接电话呀 -快接
- Answer it! - Do it!

549
00:20:02,413 --> 00:20:03,094
桑德弗医生
Dr. Sendroff?

550
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:05,720
找我什么事
What's the word?

551
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:10,880
-真的吗 -什么
- Are you serious? - What?

552
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:13,360
是这样吗
That's it?

553
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:14,360
是怎么样
What is it?!

554
00:20:14,675 --> 00:20:16,169
等等
H-hold on one second.

555
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,520
他打电话是问房子挂牌的事 我没事
He's calling about a real estate listing. I'm fine.

556
00:20:18,554 --> 00:20:19,980
就这个啊
Ay, no.

557
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:22,540
昨天 你说有问题的话会打电话
Yesterday, you said you'd call if something was wrong.

558
00:20:22,700 --> 00:20:24,920
你打了电话 接着就消失了
Then you called, then you disappeared.

559
00:20:25,340 --> 00:20:27,840
这是我这辈子见过的最不负责任
That is the most irresponsible, unprofessional thing

560
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:29,780
最没职业水准的事
I've ever heard of in my entire life!

561
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,500
你想出售的房子
And do you have anyone to represent you

562
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:32,960
现在找好经纪人了吗
in the sale of your current house?

563
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:34,320
我以眼观心过了
Look into his eyes.

564
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,660
无论医生说什么
I don't care what the doctor says.

565
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:37,409
我看他就半年命了
I give him six months.

566
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:40,520
别盯着人家看
Stop staring.

567
00:20:48,298 --> 00:20:51,129
菲尔·邓菲 介绍下你自己
So, Phil Ddunphy, tell us a little bit about yourself.

568
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:53,460
奇普 我娶了个好老婆 克莱尔
Well, Chip, I'm married to a great lady--hi, Claire!

569
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:54,880
有个宝贝女儿
And I have a baby girl.

570
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:57,940
我是个房产经纪人 喜欢下跳棋
Um, I'm a real estate agent, and I enjoy playing checkers.

571
00:20:57,940 --> 00:20:59,840
-好的 -中式西式跳棋都喜欢
- Okay. - Both chinese and american.

572
00:20:59,840 --> 00:21:02,324
还有 我超粉嘻哈风
And, uh, I am a fan of hip-hop.

573
00:21:02,740 --> 00:21:03,740
不错
Well, good for you.

574
00:21:03,780 --> 00:21:06,080
不过在东西岸嘻哈大对决中 我尽量保持中立
Though I try to stay neutral in the whole east coast/west coast thang.

575
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:08,440
-下一位... -马上说完
- Next up we have a-- - One quick thing--

576
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:10,480
向我的大学哥们林问个好
Shout out to my, uh, college buddy Ling,

577
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:13,240
他自己造了架直升机 今天首航
who built his own helicopter and is taking his first flight today,

578
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:15,705
我还要祝岳父岳母大人
and, uh, I also wanna wish a happy anniversary

579
00:21:15,705 --> 00:21:17,880
杰·普里契特伉俪结婚周年快乐
to my in-laws Jay and Dede Pritchett.

580
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:20,620
你们至死不渝的爱情给后辈作了好榜样
Your eternal love is an inspiration to us all.

581
00:21:20,780 --> 00:21:21,740
好了 说够了吧
Okay. That's enough.

582
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:25,020
下一位 来自宾州怀斯特米福的家庭主妇
Next up, we have a homemaker from West Mifflin, Pennsylvania.

583
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,140
你好
Hi.
